<title>SINGAPORE: Lim Kah Ngam 1996 net profit up 4.77 pct.</title>
<headline>Lim Kah Ngam 1996 net profit up 4.77 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   10.47   vs	9.99</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)			4.00   vs	4.00</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		   7.10   vs	6.70</p>
<p>    Group shr fully diluted (cents) 6.20   vs	5.93</p>
<p>    Turnover			    144.66   vs    134.34</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest     2.31   vs	0.91</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		 10.58   vs	8.54</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	    6.46   vs	6.12</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	   2.92   vs	2.92</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     13.94   vs     13.23</p>
<p>    Tax				     6.25   vs	6.06</p>
<p>Note - Lim Kah Ngam Ltd is in the construction and property business</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
